KUBERNETES
1. Buildar as imagens
 Abrir terminal na pasta docker-compose e rodar o comando:
 docker-compose build

2. Abrir o Terminal em docker-compose/observability/grafana/provisioning/dashboards

3. Rodar os comandos:
kubectl create configmap cs-grafana-user-dash --from-file=usuarios-api.json
kubectl create configmap cs-grafana-campaign-dash --from-file=campanhas-api.json
kubectl create configmap cs-grafana-donation-dash --from-file=donationworker.json

4. Abrir Terminal na raiz

